@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: SSH Command Runner
  "Connects to configured VPS targets and runs shell commands over SSH."

  Provides:
    - remote.SSHOptions @source("symbol:SSHOptions")
    - remote.CommandResult @source("symbol:CommandResult")
    - remote.CommandRunner @source("symbol:CommandRunner")
    - remote.SSH @source("symbol:SSH")
    - remote.SSHDialer @source("symbol:SSHDialer")
    - remote.SSHClient @source("symbol:SSHClient")
    - remote.SSHSession @source("symbol:SSHSession")
    - remote.SSHOptionsFromTarget @source("symbol:SSHOptionsFromTarget")
    - remote.NewSSH @source("symbol:NewSSH")
    - remote.NewSSHWithDialer @source("symbol:NewSSHWithDialer")
    - remote.SSH.Run @source("symbol:Run")

  Consumes:
    - config.Target

  Invariants:
    - SSHOptionsFromTarget MUST default port 22 and a 30s dial timeout when unset
    - Run MUST capture stdout, stderr, and exit code from the remote session
    - Empty key_path MUST fall back to ~/.ssh/id_ed25519

  Scenario (happy-path): Remote command succeeds
    Given valid SSH credentials and a reachable host
    When Run executes a shell command
    Then ExitCode is 0 and stdout is captured

  Scenario (negative): Connection failure
    Given an unreachable host
    When Run is invoked
    Then it returns a connect error with ExitCode -1
